  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "说一套做一套  (Saying One Thing and Doing Another)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "bu_xiaogu": "布小谷",
    "kaiwen": "凯文",
    "xingzi": "杏子"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Out by the red carpet, a floor producer pushes Bu Xiaogu's college classmates out of their front-row spots for fan clubs, while backstage Kaiwen and Xingzi uncover Unit Two's deception. Listen to the Mandarin first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "为什么要让我的同学们先撤啊？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "一会儿有整团的粉丝要过来占这儿吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "可是同学们都是好不容易找来的，而且全部都就位了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "四号机位就位了吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "你看评论席，那不是那两位有旧怨的主持人吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "我这些天跟二部折腾了多少回了！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "昨天最后确认的明明不是他们俩啊！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "二部这是说一套做一套，最后还是把他们请来了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "我现在就去找他算账！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "完了，红毯直播已经开始了！",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "为什么要让我的同学们先撤啊？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Why are you telling my classmates to leave their spots?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "一会儿有整团的粉丝要过来占这儿吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Is a whole fan group coming over to take these spots?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "可是同学们都是好不容易找来的，而且全部都就位了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Yet I worked hard to bring these classmates here, and everyone is already in place.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "四号机位就位了吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Is Camera Four in position?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "你看评论席，那不是那两位有旧怨的主持人吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Look at the commentary desk; is that not those two feuding hosts?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "我这些天跟二部折腾了多少回了！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'How many times have I gone back and forth with Unit Two over this!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "昨天最后确认的明明不是他们俩啊！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'The final list confirmed yesterday was clearly not the two of them!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "二部这是说一套做一套，最后还是把他们请来了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Unit Two said one thing and did another, inviting them in the end anyway.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "我现在就去找他算账！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I am going to confront him right now!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "完了，红毯直播已经开始了！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Too late; the live red-carpet broadcast has already started!'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "为什么要让我的同学们先撤啊？",
      "gap": 0.5
